{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51212","headline":"五言白话诗 十九 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身卧空堂内，独坐令人怕。\n我今避头去，抛却空闲舍。\n（项楚谓以上四句应自爲一首。\n）你道生时乐，吾道死时好。\n死即长夜眠，生即缘长道。\n生时愁衣食，死鬼无釜竃。\n愿作制拨鬼，入家偷吃饱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}